{
  "_readme": "Files N.png map to Tharindu's issue notes N (see ISSUES.md). annotated:true = image has QA marks drawn on it (used, but a catch there is 'assisted' since the mark points at the bug). expectClean:true = a good page where ANY raised issue = false positive. pattern = case-insensitive regex tested against each issue's title+description.",

